---
---

<section id="wall-of-love" class="section wall-of-love">
  <!-- kit: wall-of-love -->
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head section-head--center">
      <span class="eyebrow">#cookedoncaldera</span>
      <h2>4,000 campfires and counting.</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="wol-wrap is-collapsed" id="wol-wrap" style="--wol-max: 900px;">
      <div class="wol-masonry">
        <article class="wol-card wol-social">
          <header class="wol-card-head">
            <img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/192?img=47" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="wol-who"><strong>Maya Reyes</strong><span>@mayaoutside</span></span>
            <span class="wol-source" title="Posted on X">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.8 3h3.1l-6.8 7.8L22 21h-6.2l-4.9-6.4L5.3 21H2.2l7.3-8.3L2 3h6.4l4.4 5.8zm-1.1 16.2h1.7L7.4 4.7H5.6z"/></svg>
              <span class="visually-hidden">X</span>
            </span>
          </header>
          <p>Took the Cable Fold on a 6-day Wind River trip. Grilled trout every night, folded it flat every morning. Best thing in my pack and I've been guiding for 12 years.</p>
          <a class="wol-meta" href="https://x.com/mayaoutside/status/1815500112233" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><time datetime="2026-07-22">22 Jul 2026</time> · View post</a>
        </article>

        <article class="wol-card wol-review">
          <header class="wol-card-head">
            <span class="wol-stars" aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"><span aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span></span>
            <span class="wol-source wol-source--text">REI</span>
          </header>
          <h3>Heirloom quality</h3>
          <p>Heavier than titanium, obviously, but nothing else sears like this over a fire. Seasoning held up to a week of eggs and bacon.</p>
          <p class="wol-reviewer"><strong>Jordan K.</strong> <span class="wol-verified">Verified buyer</span></p>
          <a class="wol-meta" href="https://www.rei.com/product/caldera-ridge-skillet#reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><time datetime="2026-06-03">3 Jun 2026</time> · Review on REI</a>
        </article>

        <article class="wol-card wol-photo">
          <img class="wol-photo-img" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/ugc-trail-kitchen/900/1100" alt="A Dutch oven of chilli on a granite slab at sunset" width="1800" height="2200" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="wol-photo-body">
            <header class="wol-card-head">
              <span class="wol-who"><strong>@trailkitchen</strong></span>
              <span class="wol-source" title="Posted on Instagram">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
                <span class="visually-hidden">Instagram</span>
              </span>
            </header>
            <p>Chilli at 11,000 ft. The Ember came along for all 4 days.</p>
            <a class="wol-meta" href="https://www.instagram.com/p/C9xK2aLvT1m/" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">View on Instagram</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="wol-card wol-review">
          <header class="wol-card-head">
            <span class="wol-stars" aria-label="Rated 4 out of 5"><span aria-hidden="true">★★★★<span class="wol-star-off">★</span></span></span>
            <span class="wol-source wol-source--text">Caldera</span>
          </header>
          <h3>Great pan, read the care card</h3>
          <p>Rusted a little after I left it wet overnight — my fault. Re-oiled it and it's been perfect since. Customer service sent a care kit for free.</p>
          <p class="wol-reviewer"><strong>Sam O.</strong> <span class="wol-verified">Verified buyer</span></p>
          <p class="wol-meta"><time datetime="2026-05-18">18 May 2026</time> · Review on caldera.co</p>
        </article>

        <article class="wol-card wol-social">
          <header class="wol-card-head">
            <img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/192?img=68" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="wol-who"><strong>Theo Lindqvist</strong><span>@theohikes</span></span>
            <span class="wol-source" title="Posted on Bluesky">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6.3 4.2C8.6 6 11.1 9.5 12 11.4c.9-1.9 3.4-5.4 5.7-7.2 1.7-1.2 4.3-2.2 4.3.8 0 .6-.3 5-.5 5.7-.7 2.5-3.2 3.1-5.5 2.7 4 .7 5 2.9 2.8 5.2-4.2 4.3-6-1.1-6.5-2.4l-.3-.8-.3.8c-.5 1.3-2.3 6.7-6.5 2.4-2.2-2.3-1.2-4.5 2.8-5.2-2.3.4-4.8-.2-5.5-2.7C2.3 10 2 5.6 2 5c0-3 2.6-2 4.3-.8z"/></svg>
              <span class="visually-hidden">Bluesky</span>
            </span>
          </header>
          <p>PCT update: still carrying the Trail Kettle at mile 1,900. Every other piece of gear has been replaced at least once.</p>
          <a class="wol-meta" href="https://bsky.app/profile/theohikes.bsky.social/post/3l2kq7xyz" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><time datetime="2026-08-30">30 Aug 2026</time> · View post</a>
        </article>

        <article class="wol-card wol-review">
          <header class="wol-card-head">
            <span class="wol-stars" aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"><span aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span></span>
            <span class="wol-source wol-source--text">Google</span>
          </header>
          <p>Toured the foundry in Bend — they let my kids pour sand into the moulds. Bought two skillets on the way out.</p>
          <p class="wol-reviewer"><strong>Lena W.</strong></p>
          <a class="wol-meta" href="https://maps.google.com/?cid=1188223344556677" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><time datetime="2026-04-11">11 Apr 2026</time> · Review on Google</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="btn-row wol-more">
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="wol-wrap">Show more</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .wol-wrap { position: relative; }
  .wol-wrap.is-collapsed {
    max-height: var(--wol-max);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .wol-wrap.is-collapsed::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    height: 160px;
    background: linear-gradient(transparent, var(--bg));
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .wol-masonry {
    columns: 3 260px;
    column-gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  .wol-card {
    break-inside: avoid;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--bg);
  }
  .wol-card p { color: var(--ink-2); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .wol-card h3 { font-size: 1.0625rem; margin-bottom: 0.375rem; }
  .wol-card-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
  }
  .wol-card-head img { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; }
  .wol-who { display: grid; line-height: 1.3; min-width: 0; }
  .wol-who span { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--ink-3); }
  .wol-source { margin-left: auto; color: var(--ink-3); display: inline-flex; }
  .wol-source--text {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  .wol-stars { color: var(--brand); letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
  .wol-star-off { color: var(--line); }
  .wol-reviewer { font-size: 0.875rem; }
  .wol-reviewer strong { color: var(--ink); }
  .wol-verified {
    margin-left: 0.375rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--success);
  }
  .wol-card .wol-meta {
    display: block;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  a.wol-meta:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .wol-photo { padding: 0; overflow: hidden; }
  .wol-photo-img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 9 / 11; object-fit: cover; }
  .wol-photo-body { padding: 1.25rem; }
  .wol-more { justify-content: center; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>

<script is:inline>
  (function () {
    var root = document.getElementById("wall-of-love");
    if (!root) return;
    var wrap = root.querySelector(".wol-wrap");
    var btn = root.querySelector(".wol-more button");
    if (!wrap || !btn) return;
    function sync() {
      var max = parseInt(getComputedStyle(wrap).getPropertyValue("--wol-max"), 10) || 900;
      if (!wrap.classList.contains("is-collapsed")) return;
      if (wrap.scrollHeight <= max + 1) {
        wrap.classList.remove("is-collapsed");
        btn.parentElement.hidden = true;
      }
    }
    btn.addEventListener("click", function () {
      var collapsed = wrap.classList.toggle("is-collapsed");
      btn.setAttribute("aria-expanded", collapsed ? "false" : "true");
      btn.textContent = collapsed ? "Show more" : "Show less";
    });
    sync();
    window.addEventListener("load", sync);
  })();
</script>
